{
  "reason": "progress_update",
  "message": "Found two concrete lifecycle races: playback's global play promise/event callbacks can clobber a newer clip after error/source replacement; recorder keeps a stopped recorder and global chunks/discard, so starting again before async stop runs can corrupt/duplicate clips. Also pause-resume click path only checks queued blobs, not retained currentBlob."
}

